	A sure way to tell if you're in Wizard Mode is to type "?" (or
whatever your particular version wants for help).  If a new line is
present at the bottom (Wizard options, or something like that) then
you're in business.  It will tell you that control-W is for wishing.
	Of course (read "I seem to recall that"), unless you are the one
person empowered by the source code to enter wiz mode, you'll just be
punted into discovery mode instead.
